<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-14177] Query parallelism ignores &quot;NULLS LAST&quot; in &quot;order by&quot; clause</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-14177</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;If set&#160;QueryParallelism to some value &amp;gt;=2, then &quot;NULLS LAST&quot; is ignored in &quot;order by clause&quot;.&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;e.g.&#160;SELECT * FROM &amp;lt;TABLE&amp;gt; ORDER BY &amp;lt;COLUMN&amp;gt; ASC NULLS LAST&lt;/p&gt;


&lt;p&gt;A small reproducer is attached.&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
